{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_14114160","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14114160","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1411415001:":{"text":"다들 괜찮아?","source_cn":"你们都没事吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA40B9C00AA335B37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1411416001:0":{"text":"크, 큰일이야. 아니, 다행이야! 여기 있었구나, 조아!","source_cn":"不、不好了——不对，太好了！幸好你在这里，祖娅！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35C4329E7A60CC7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1411416002:0":{"text":"저 아래 광산에 웬 뾰족귀 여자애가 나타나서는 갑자기 폭탄을 던져대는 거 있지!","source_cn":"下头矿区来了个尖耳朵小丫头，突然就开始到处乱炸！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30AD64E503CA2869","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1411416003:1":{"text":"뭐? 아래 광산에서 무슨 일이 일어났다고? 누가 뭘 던져?!","source_cn":"怎么回事？下面矿区出事了？有人在搞破坏？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDE396F31E88FF86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1411416004:0":{"text":"처음에는 멀쩡했는데 갑자기 폭탄을 던져댔다고!","source_cn":"也不是搞破坏，一开始她还好好的，突然就开始扔炸弹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA762492431DCB7BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1411416005:0":{"text":"방금 쾅쾅대는 소리 들었지? 그 아이 짓이야!","source_cn":"刚刚你们听见轰隆隆的声音了吗？就是她干的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5F56604E1378364","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1411416006:2":{"text":"갑자기 폭탄을 던지는 소녀라...","source_cn":"……突然扔炸弹的小丫头……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49316B4F903E41A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1411416007:0":{"text":"자네들, 그 소녀의 생김새를 기억하는가? 폭탄은 어떤 모양이었지? 혹시 싸움이라도 벌였던 건가?","source_cn":"二位，你们说的那个小姑娘，她长什么样子？是怎样的炸弹？...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C36C2D12CA6B685","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1411416008:0":{"text":"윽, 그렇게 물어봐도 잘 모르겠어. 그냥 너희 꺽다리들처럼 생겼는데.","source_cn":"呃，你这么问我们也搞不清楚，就是你们长身人的那样子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD7BC9679CCEDCCC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1411416009:0":{"text":"뾰족귀랑 비슷하긴 했지. 눈도 있고 코도 있고, 키는 크고 귀는 뾰족하고...","source_cn":"我觉得和那帮尖耳朵挺像的，有鼻子有眼睛，个子高高耳朵尖...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14FB4654F72C8C69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1411416010:0":{"text":"근데 어떻게 생겼는지는 기억 안 나.","source_cn":"具体鼻子眼睛怎么摆的，我们也看不清楚啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A5BECE0C83A94DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1411416011:0":{"text":"그리고 마찰도 별로 없었어. 그냥 누가 좀 뭐라고 하니까 갑자기 화를 냈어.","source_cn":"而且也没冲突，就是不知道谁说了两句，她突然就生气了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2645C3C24E74C0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1411416012:0":{"text":"폭탄은 까맣고 동그래서... 아, 맞아. 폭탄이랑 대화를 하던데?","source_cn":"炸弹，就是黑黑的，圆圆的——对了，她还跟她的炸弹说话呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BDEEEBE08F89BC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1411416013:1":{"text":"대부분의 드워프는 다른 종족을 잘 구별하지 못해. 그래서 별로 경계하지도 않지. ","source_cn":"大部分矮人都分不清长身人的模样，所以也通常没什么戒心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE69BC935B5A8332D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1411416014:1":{"text":"소녀처럼 생겼는데 갑자기 화를 내고, 폭탄을 던지는 데다가 그 폭탄과 대화도 했다라...","source_cn":"长相就姑且当做是少女的样子，但是突然生气，扔炸弹，和炸...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3545044A6C452ACE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1411416015:0":{"text":"조아, 상황이 생각보다 심각하네. 어서 내려가야 하네.","source_cn":"祖娅，事情很可能比预想得更严重，我们赶紧下去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60D11DD98465042A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1411416016:0":{"text":"알았어. 너희 둘도 따라와. 같이 작업을 중단시키자.","source_cn":"好，你们两个也跟我来，一起组织下面停工。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E01479B5B9AE6F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1411416017:1":{"text":"아, 맞다. 올라올 때 그 애 못 봤어? 방금 여길 떠난 것 같던데.","source_cn":"咦，对了，你们刚刚上来没看到她吗？她刚才从这边离开的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D6905C978A2E716","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1411416018:1":{"text":"아니. 그냥 쾅쾅거리는 소리만 들었어.","source_cn":"没有，但我倒是听见轰隆一声。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A265D4A7C2CAAE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1411416019:1":{"text":"폭탄을 잘 다루던데, 새로운 길이라도 뚫은 거 아니겠어?","source_cn":"她很会用炸弹，估计刚刚又打通了新通道吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x218CC3080448D3A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1411416020:1":{"text":"지하에서 마음대로 폭탄을 쓰고 새로운 길까지 뚫다니... 대체 뭐 하는 애야, 바엘란?","source_cn":"在这地下随便动用炸弹，还自己开了新通道……这小姑娘是什...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE0822AAE4B3339B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1411416021:1":{"text":"지금은 단정할 수 없네. 하지만 내가 생각하는 그 이가 아니기를 빌 뿐이지.","source_cn":"现在还不好说，但我希望不是我认识的那位。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E982B72CB88CB90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1411416022:1":{"text":"어서 가세. 더 늦으면 또 무슨 일을 벌일지 모르니까!","source_cn":"快点走吧，免得再耽搁一会儿，她又做出什么事来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x251541CBFA5880DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:31:14014023:0":{"text":"지진이 다시 일어났다! 두 광부가 허둥지둥 달려와 조아를 찾았다.","source_cn":"地震再次爆发！两个矿工慌慌张张地跑来找祖娅。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA217AE9151B4750E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"조아","source":"祖娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:矿区负责人":{"text":"광산 책임자","source":"矿区负责人","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:负责人助手":{"text":"책임자의 조수","source":"负责人助手","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:巴赫朗":{"text":"바엘란","source":"巴赫朗","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":29,"localized_text_count":24,"speaker_count":5}}